OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFlight chaos caused by software
OL,4,Adefect in the 'space of a millisecond',
OL,5,Areport says
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn air traffic control system failure
OL,8,Fthat sparked widespread travel chaos
OL,9,Fearlier this month was caused by a
OL,10,F"software defect", the UK's national
OL,11,Fair traffic service (Nats) has said.
OL,13,FThe problem happened "in the space of a
OL,14,Fmillisecond", Nats said, leading to the
OL,15,Fsystem producing corrupted data.
OL,17,FThe failure led to more than 2,000
OL,18,Fflights being cancelled and hundreds of
OL,19,Fthousands of passengers affected, with
OL,20,Fsome sleeping on airport floors or
OL,21,Fgetting stuck overseas.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
